when a reload fails to open or authenticate.

https://github.com/dheerajshenoy/lektra/issues/85
https://github.com/dheerajshenoy/lektra/commit/4205f1f2e618d68bc78accdb951e6d2fb01449f7
https://github.com/dheerajshenoy/lektra/commit/6a1d0f6e4bcf23a561f713385d08fa8d7fc404c8

